# Nothing here is referenced by the site, and every path below is publicly
# fetchable once deployed. Keeping them out of the build is the fix; the
# X-Robots-Tag rules in vercel.json are the second line of defence in case
# this file is ever dropped.

# Internal design specs. Not public writing, and thin duplicate content if
# indexed.
docs/

# Brand source: the Illustrator master, the intro .docx, the site map, and
# "Website Copy.md" — which is the entire site's copy in plaintext and would
# read to a crawler as a perfect duplicate of all four pages.
ASSETS/

# Raw video masters. Gitignored already, but a local working copy would
# otherwise still be uploaded from the working tree.
VIDEOS/hf_*

# Windows thumbnail cache.
Thumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db

# Editor/workspace files.
nexus-global.code-workspace
.claude/
